  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 702.01 Applicability of Microbiological MCLs and MCLGs. The microbiological MCLs and MCLGs shall apply to all systems as defined in Env-Dw 701.05.\n\nSource. #9699, eff 5-1-10; ss by #12665, eff 1-1-19",
